    CtxDecode --> Adapters : set_inputs applies LoRA
    GCtx --> Adapters : build_lora_mm / build_cvec
    GResult --> Sampling : t_sampled_logits / t_sampled
    GSampl --> Sampling : adds sampling graph ops

